---
import { img } from '../data/images';
---
<section id="studio" class="sec wrap about">
  <div class="a-img rv"><img src={img.about} width="1200" height="1500" loading="lazy" alt="Designers reviewing concepts together in a meeting" onerror="this.style.display='none'" />
  <img class="inset" src={img.aboutDetail} width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" alt="Bright creative workspace with desks" onerror="this.style.display='none'" /></div>
  <div class="a-copy rv"><p class="label">The studio</p><h2>Ideas first. <em>Craft</em> always.</h2>
  <p>We believe distinctive brands come from clear thinking, strong taste and close collaboration. This is sample copy for a concept studio — swap in your own story.</p>
  <ul class="pr"><li><b>Be specific.</b> A sharp idea beats a safe one.</li><li><b>Show the work.</b> Open process, no black boxes.</li><li><b>Sweat the details.</b> Type, spacing, timing.</li></ul></div>
</section>
